# Advertisement Click Prediction Using Logistic Regression

## Overview
This project uses machine learning to predict whether a user clicks on an advertisement using Logistic Regression.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Scikit-learn
- Jupyter Notebook

## Project Workflow
- Data loading and validation
- Exploratory data analysis
- Feature selection and preprocessing
- Train-test split
- Logistic Regression model training
- Model evaluation
- ShuffleSplit cross-validation
- K-Fold cross-validation

## Files
- `data_validation.ipynb` — Jupyter Notebook containing the implementation.
- `advertising.csv` — Dataset used for model development.

## How to Run
1. Clone or download this repository.
2. Install the required Python libraries.
3. Place the dataset in the same directory as the notebook.
4. Open the notebook in Jupyter and run all cells.

